{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1147463-merits-and-defects-for-chimeras","id":1147463,"title":"Merits and defects for Chimeras?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-10-06T09:24:45-07:00","id":1147463,"title":"Merits and defects for Chimeras?","content":"So I was making a Chimera for a character I'm going to use in an upcoming game and I was following the rules for creating a Chimera, and I was just wondering if it is valid to use the merits and defects and how would they translate in chimera points. Is it at the same rate? 1 chimera point=flaw point? Or is there anything else I could use to rule it? Is there a suplement that deals with this?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13478-drakeepsilon","name":"DrakeEpsilon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13478_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"43"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-06T11:13:14-07:00","id":1147493,"title":"","content":"You can compare costs of the same Traits in Freebies and Chimera Points and use it as a rough estimation for buying Merits/Flaws.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>...","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5211-firkraag","name":"Firkraag","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5211_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"381"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-06T11:52:43-07:00","id":1147513,"title":"","content":"I'd say &quot;1 chimera point=1 merit point&quot; is an okay deal..<br /> <br /> But it totally depends on how your Storyteller values Merits and Flaws (and it might depend on which exactly), compared to the Chimera points. And whether your Storyteller would want to give you access to them at all, and to what degree, if so.<br /> <br /> It might as well be &quot;1 chimera point=3 merit points&quot; (Glamour) or 6 (Abilities) or 15 (Attributes). Or vice versa (Willpower).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>...","edited":{"userid":5211,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5211-firkraag","user":"Firkraag","date":". 10-06-2017, 03:07 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5211-firkraag","name":"Firkraag","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5211_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"381"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-06T01:53:05-08:00","id":1156260,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrakeEpsilon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1147463-merits-and-defects-for-chimeras#post1147463\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So I was making a Chimera for a character I'm going to use in an upcoming game and I was following the rules for creating a Chimera, and I was just wondering if it is valid to use the merits and defects and how would they translate in chimera points. Is it at the same rate? 1 chimera point=flaw point? Or is there anything else I could use to rule it? Is there a suplement that deals with this?</div> </div> </div> </div>If it helps, I wrote that section. I totally rule you can translate it directly across, with chimera points trading on a one-for-one for Merits and gained from Flaws, to the usual character max of ... 7? 10? Mileage may vary according to individual Storytellers and groups, but that's how I'd do it at my table if I needed to.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Luka Carroll</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer &amp; Developer<br /> <i>Working On: </i>C20 Player's Guide, Lunars<br /> <i>Worked On: </i>V20 TMR, Demon STG, C20, Book of Freeholds, Conquering Heroes, Building A Legend, Dragon-Blooded, The Realm","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3785-luka-c","name":"Luka C","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3785_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"175"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}